 email lists, send email campaigns, build funnels, and make more profit and increase your conversion rates. (Yes, It’s Free!)'=>'是最佳且功能齊全的電子郵件行銷與 CRM 解決方案。它也是 WordPress 上最簡單、最快速的 CRM 和行銷外掛。管理客戶關係、建立名單、傳送行銷信件、建立行銷漏斗、創造利潤並提高轉換率。(是的，它是免費的！)','Get real-time notification on your Discord Channel on any email sending failure. Configure notification with Discord to start getting real time notifications.'=>'當電子郵件傳送失敗時，在你的 Discord 頻道接收即時通知。設定 Discord 通知即可開始接收即時提醒。','Get real-time notification on your Slack Channel on any email sending failure. Configure notification with Slack Bot to start getting real time notifications.'=>'當電子郵件傳送失敗時，在你的 Slack 頻道接收即時通知。設定 Slack 機器人通知即可開始接收即時提醒。','Simply copy the following snippet and replace the stars with the corresponding credential. Then simply paste to wp-config.php file of your WordPress installation'=>'只需複製以下程式碼片段，並將星號替換為相應的憑證。然後將其貼到 WordPress 安裝目錄下的 wp-config.php 檔案中。','Your FluentSMTP plugin is currently integrated with your Discord Channel. Receive timely notifications on Discord for any email sending issues from your website. This ongoing connection ensures you\'re always informed about your email delivery status.'=>'你的 FluentSMTP 外掛目前已與你的 Discord 頻道整合。你可以透過 Discord 及時收到網站電子郵件傳送問題的通知。此連線可確保你隨時掌握電子郵件的遞送狀態。','Your FluentSMTP plugin is currently integrated with your Slack Channel. Receive timely notifications on Slack for any email sending issues from your website. This ongoing connection ensures you\'re always informed about your email delivery status.'=>'你的 FluentSMTP 外掛目前已與你的 Slack 頻道整合。你可以透過 Slack 及時收到網站電子郵件傳送問題的通知。此連線可確保你隨時掌握電子郵件的遞送狀態。','Your Gmail / Google Workspace Authentication has been enabled. No further action is needed. If you want to re-authenticate,'=>'你的 Gmail / Google Workspace 驗證已啟用。無需進一步操作。如果你想重新驗證，','Join our communities and participate in great conversations.'=>'加入我們的社群並參與精彩的對話。','FluentSMTP is powered by community. We listen to our community users and build products that add value to businesses and save time.'=>'FluentSMTP 由社群驅動。我們聆聽社群使用者的意見，建立能為企業增加價值並節省時間的產品。','FluentSMTP is powered by its users like you. Feel free to contribute on Github. Thanks to all of our contributors.'=>'FluentSMTP 由像你這樣的使用者提供動力。歡迎在 Github 上做出貢獻。感謝所有貢獻者。','FluentSMTP is free and will be always free. This is our pledge to WordPress community from WPManageNinja LLC.'=>'FluentSMTP 是免費的，且永遠會維持免費。這是 WPManageNinja LLC 對 WordPress 社群的承諾。','is a free and open-source WordPress Plugin. Our mission is to provide the ultimate email delivery solution with your favorite Email sending service. FluentSMTP is built for performance and speed.'=>'是一款免費且開源的 WordPress 外掛。我們的使命是配合你喜愛的電子郵件傳送服務，提供極致的電子郵件遞送解決方案。FluentSMTP 是為了效能與速度而生。','Enter email address where test email will be sent (By default, logged in user email will be used if email address is not provided).'=>'輸入測試電子郵件的收件地址 (如果未提供電子郵件地址，預設將使用已登入使用者的電子郵件)。','Return Path indicates where non-delivery receipts - or bounce messages - are to be sent. If unchecked, bounce messages may be lost. With this enabled, you\'ll be emailed using "From Email" if any messages bounce as a result of issues with the recipient’s email.'=>'退信路徑 (Return Path) 指出未遞送收據 (或退信訊息) 應傳送至何處。如果未勾選，退信訊息可能會遺失。啟用此功能後，如果電子郵件因收件者問題而被退回，你將透過「寄件者電子郵件」收到通知。','Your SMTP Username'=>'你的 SMTP 使用者名稱','Your Name'=>'你的姓名','Your Email Address'=>'你的電子郵件地址','Your Email'=>'你的電子郵件','Your Discord Channel Webhook URL'=>'你的 Discord 頻道 Webhook 網址','Your Discord Channel Name (For Internal Use)'=>'你的 Discord 頻道名稱 (內部使用)','You may add additional sending emails in this'=>'你可以在此增加額外的傳送電子郵件','Yes, Disconnect'=>'是，斷開連線','Write a review (really appreciated 😊)'=>'撰寫評論 (非常感謝 😊)','Use Auto TLS'=>'使用自動 TLS','Try Again'=>'再試一次','Transactional'=>'觸發式郵件','Track Opens'=>'追蹤開啟','To send emails you will need only a Mail Send access level for this API key.'=>'傳送電子郵件僅需要此 API 金鑰具備「郵件傳送」存取權限。','The name which emails are sent from.'=>'電子郵件顯示的傳送者姓名。','The email address which emails are sent from.'=>'電子郵件顯示的傳送者地址。','The email address must match t