                    衝突。','Go To FluentSMTP Settings'=>'前往FluentSMTP設定','. It\'s compatible with various SMTP services, including Amazon SES, SendGrid, MailGun, ElasticEmail, SendInBlue, Google, Microsoft, and others, providing you with a wide range of options for your email needs.'=>'。它與多種SMTP服務相容，包括Amazon SES、SendGrid、MailGun、ElasticEmail、SendInBlue、Google、Microsoft等，為你的電子郵件需求提供廣泛的選擇。','learn why it\'s free'=>'瞭解為何免費','You seem to be looking for an SMTP plugin, but there\'s no need for another one — FluentSMTP is already installed on your site. FluentSMTP is a comprehensive, free, and open-source plugin with full features available without any upsell'=>'你似乎正在尋找SMTP外掛，但不需要另一個了 —— FluentSMTP已經安裝在你的網站上。FluentSMTP是一款全方位、免費且開放原始碼的外掛，提供完整功能且無任何追加銷售','For SMTP, you already have FluentSMTP Installed'=>'在SMTP方面，你已經安裝了FluentSMTP','All Time'=>'不限時間','Last 30 Days'=>'過去30天','Last 7 Days'=>'過去7天','Less'=>'顯示較少','More'=>'顯示更多','Sending by time of day'=>'依時段顯示傳送量','Telegram connection has been disconnected successfully'=>'Telegram連線已成功中斷','Telegram notification is not enabled'=>'Telegram通知未啟用','Connection successful'=>'連線成功','Please provide site token'=>'請提供網站權杖','Awesome! Please activate the connection from your telegram account.'=>'太棒了！請從你的Telegram帳號啟用連線。','Slack connection has been disconnected successfully'=>'Slack連線已成功中斷','Awesome! You are redirecting to slack'=>'太棒了！正在將你重新導向至Slack','Email has been removed successfully'=>'電子郵件已成功移除','Email has been added successfully'=>'電子郵件已成功加入','Please provide a valid email address'=>'請提供有效的電子郵件地址','Discord connection has been disconnected successfully'=>'Discord連線已成功中斷','Test message sent successfully'=>'測試訊息已成功傳送','Slack notification is not enabled'=>'Slack通知未啟用','Your settings has been saved'=>'你的設定已儲存','Channel Name required'=>'必須提供頻道名稱','Webhook URL is required'=>'必須提供Webhook網址','Alerts'=>'警示','PHP mail()'=>'PHP mail()','Outlook or Office 365'=>'Outlook或Office 365','Netcore Email API, formerly Pepipost'=>'Netcore Email API (前身為Pepipo